---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import SiteHeader from "../../../components/SiteHeader.astro";
import SiteFooter from "../../../components/SiteFooter.astro";
import { company } from "../../../data/site";
import heroPhoto from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/caixilharia-vidro-fumado.webp";
import roofMaintenance from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/cobertura-metalica-substituicao.webp";
import annexStructure from "../../../../../../images/catalogue/anexo-coberto-estrutura-metalica.webp";
---
<BaseLayout title="Facilities and Maintenance Services | HMATIAS Angola" description="Facilities management, building maintenance, cleaning and operational support for business and institutional premises in Angola." lang="en">
  <div class="preview-bar"><span><i aria-hidden="true"></i> HMATIAS FACILITIES</span><span>MAINTENANCE · CLEANING · OPERATIONS</span></div>
  <SiteHeader />
  <main class="facilities-page">
    <section class="construction-hero" id="inicio">
      <div class="construction-hero-copy">
        <nav class="construction-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/en/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Facilities and Maintenance</span></nav>
        <p class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-line"></span> FACILITIES · BUILDING MAINTENANCE</p>
        <h1>Facilities and<br /><em>maintenance.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">Maintenance, upkeep and operational support for business and institutional premises.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button button-light" href="#request">Request an assessment <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a><a class="text-link text-link-light" href="#evidence">View recorded interventions <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div>
        <div class="hero-meta"><span>Maintenance · Cleaning · Operational support</span><span>Luanda · Angola</span></div>
      </div>
      <figure class="construction-hero-image"><Image src={heroPhoto} alt="Aluminium window framing and tinted glass in a building" widths={[640,960,1280]} sizes="(max-width:900px) 100vw, 48vw" format="webp" quality={84} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption><span>01</span> HMATIAS INTERVENTION RECORD</figcaption></figure>
      <span class="construction-hero-note" aria-hidden="true">UPKEEP · MAINTENANCE · OPERATIONS</span>
    </section>
    <section class="construction-intro section-pad" id="company">
      <div class="section-kicker">01 / SERVICE AREA</div>
      <div class="construction-intro-content"><h2>Well-maintained premises.<br /><em>Clearly defined services.</em></h2><div class="construction-intro-copy"><p>HMATIAS provides facilities and maintenance services for companies and institutions. The scope includes building maintenance, professional cleaning, roof upkeep and operational support.</p><p>Frequency, areas, resources, materials and responsibilities are defined before each service begins.</p><a class="underlined-link" href="#evidence">Review documented interventions <span aria-hidden="true">↘</span></a></div></div>
    </section>
    <section class="construction-scopes section-pad" id="services">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">02 / SERVICES</div><h2>Maintenance and operations<br /><em>for the working environment.</em></h2></div><p>Services are organised according to the condition of the premises and the requirements identified.</p></div>
      <div class="construction-scope-grid">
        <article class="construction-scope-card"><span>01</span><h3>Building maintenance</h3><p>Preventive or corrective interventions, planned or one-off, according to the agreed scope.</p></article>
        <article class="construction-scope-card"><span>02</span><h3>Cleaning and upkeep</h3><p>Cleaning of offices, facilities and frequently used areas, with an agreed service frequency.</p></article>
        <article class="construction-scope-card"><span>03</span><h3>Operational support</h3><p>Requirements assessment, intervention coordination and follow-up of the agreed work.</p></article>
        <article class="construction-scope-card"><span>04</span><h3>Roofing and structural maintenance</h3><p>Localised interventions in roof coverings, metal structures and supporting elements.</p></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="construction-work section-pad" id="evidence">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">03 / RECORDED INTERVENTIONS</div><h2>Work documented<br /><em>on existing premises.</em></h2></div><p>Selected photographs showing the type of intervention recorded by HMATIAS.</p></div>
      <div class="construction-work-grid">
        <article class="construction-work-card"><figure><Image src={roofMaintenance} alt="Localised replacement of metal roof sheets on an existing facility" widths={[640,960]} sizes="(max-width:650px) 100vw,50vw" format="webp" quality={82}/></figure><div class="construction-work-caption"><span>ROOF MAINTENANCE</span><h3>Localised roof replacement</h3><p>Replacement of metal roof sheets on an existing installation.</p></div></article>
        <article class="construction-work-card"><figure><Image src={annexStructure} alt="Metal roof structure over a covered annex beside an existing building" widths={[640,960]} sizes="(max-width:650px) 100vw,50vw" format="webp" quality={82}/></figure><div class="construction-work-caption"><span>STRUCTURAL INTERVENTION</span><h3>Covered annex structure</h3><p>Metal roofing structure applied to an annex supporting the existing premises.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="construction-method section-pad">
      <div class="section-heading"><div><div class="section-kicker">04 / SERVICE COORDINATION</div><h2>Define the service.<br /><em>Agree the operating conditions.</em></h2></div><p>Ongoing maintenance requires clear responsibilities and a schedule that reflects how the premises are used.</p></div>
      <div class="construction-method-list">
        <article><span>01</span><div><h3>Assess the premises</h3><p>Identify the areas, current condition, expected tasks and access requirements.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>02</span><div><h3>Agree the service plan</h3><p>Define frequency, resources, materials, responsibilities and reporting arrangements.</p></div></article>
        <article><span>03</span><div><h3>Deliver and follow up</h3><p>Coordinate the agreed work and communicate any relevant changes or additional requirements.</p></div></article>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="construction-request section-pad" id="request">
      <div class="construction-request-copy"><p class="section-kicker">05 / SERVICE ENQUIRIES</p><h2>Let's assess<br /><em>your premises.</em></h2><p>Share the location, the areas involved, the type of service required and the preferred frequency. HMATIAS can review the scope and identify the information needed for a proposal.</p><div class="construction-request-actions"><a class="button button-light" href={`mailto:${company.commercialEmail}?subject=Facilities%20service%20enquiry`}>Request an assessment <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="construction-email-link" href={company.whatsappUri} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">WhatsApp <span>↗</span></a></div></div>
      <aside class="construction-request-guide"><h3>Information to include</h3><ul><li>Premises location</li><li>Areas and type of facility</li><li>Tasks or issues identified</li><li>Required frequency</li><li>Preferred start date</li></ul><p>The service scope and operating conditions are subject to assessment and agreement.</p></aside>
    </section>
  </main>
  <SiteFooter />
  <div class="preview-disclaimer">Independent technology preview. It does not replace or modify the official HMATIAS website.</div>
</BaseLayout>